                <p>Drafted and transmitted by Stabler. Cleared by Moore of GTI and by S/S1. Repeated
                    to London.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d158-f2" n="2" xml:id="d158-f2-content">
                <p>Reference is to the forthcoming meetings of the Foreign Ministers of the United
                    States, United Kingdom, and France, at Washington, September 10–14; for
                    documentation, see <ref target="frus1951v03p1#pg_1163">vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">iii</hi>, pt. 1, pp. 1163</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d158-f3" n="3" xml:id="d158-f3-content">
                <p>For documentation on the admission of Greece and Turkey to NATO, see <ref
                        target="frus1951v03p1#pg_460">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, pp. 460</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d158-f4" n="4" xml:id="d158-f4-content">
                <p>For documentation on the formulation of the Mutual Security Program, see <ref
                        target="frus1951v01#pg_266">vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, pp.
                        266</ref> ff. For documentation on proposed aid to the Arab states and
                    Israel under the Mutual Security Program, see <ref target="#pg1">pp. 1</ref>
                    ff.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
